              <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-700">ILUSTRE COLEGIO DE ABOGADOS LA PAZ</h3>
            </div>
            <button id="cerrar-dialog-tiquet"
              class="text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600 transition-colors duration-200 p-1 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-100"
              aria-label="Cerrar resultados de búsqueda">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark fa-2x"></i>
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6">
            <hr class="border-t-2 border-slate-200" />
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="text-center mb-6">
              <h1 class="uppercase font-bold text-slate-800 text-xl mb-2">Ticket de Denuncia</h1>
              <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-yellow-400 mx-auto rounded"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="bg-amber-50 p-4 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-yellow-600">
                <h2 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-lg">
                  N° de Ticket:
                  <span id="number-tiquet" class="text-yellow-600">
                    00003
                  </span>
                </h2>
              </div>

              <div class="grid gap-3">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-2 border-b border-gray-100">
                  <span class="font-medium text-gray-600">Fecha de Registro:</span>
                  <span id="number-date" class="text-gray-800 font-medium"></span>
                </div>

                <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-2 border-b border-gray-100">
                  <span class="font-medium text-gray-600">Área:</span>
                  <span class="text-gray-800 font-medium text-right">Unidad de Denuncia y Seguimiento</span>
                </div>

                <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-2 border-b border-gray-100">
                  <span class="font-medium text-gray-600">Estado:</span>
                  <span id="contenido-tiquet"
                    class="font-bold text-green-600 bg-green-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">
                    Enviado
                  </span>
                </div>
              </div>


              <div class="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-lg mt-4">
                <p id="resultado-tiquet" class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                  Gracias por su denuncia. Nuestro equipo la revisará y se comunicará con usted en caso de requerir
                  mayor información.
                </p>
              </div>


              <button id="imprimir-tiquet"
                class="w-full bg-yellow-500 hover:bg-yellow-600 text-white font-medium py-3 px-4 rounded-lg transition-colors duration-200 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mt-6 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-print"></i>
                Imprimir Tiquet
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
